  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><span><img alt=\"New\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>This page talks about <b>new  things</b>. As such, there may be inaccurate or missing information. What you see here may change over time.\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br>\n</p><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/4b/Halloween_Treats_Maker.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021180133\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Halloween Treats Maker</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Machine</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 17</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 slot(s)</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Halloween Treats Maker</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">production building</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 17. It was delivered by <a href=\"/wiki/alfred-4276\" title=\"Alfred\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Alfred</a> the Mailman on October 8th, 2024. It automatically disappears after November 1st, 2024.\n</p><p>It does not need to be repaired or bought. It is given for free.\n</p><p>It is used to make various types of Halloween treats.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\">2024</span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHalloween_Treats_Maker.png\" title=\"Halloween Treats Maker.png (299 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/4b/Halloween_Treats_Maker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241021180133\" title=\"Halloween Treats Maker.png (299 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Halloween Treats Maker.png (299 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Halloween Treats Maker</div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\">2025</span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHalloween_Treats_Maker_2025.png\" title=\"Halloween Treats Maker 2025.png (300 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/52/Halloween_Treats_Maker_2025.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251023204845\" title=\"Halloween Treats Maker 2025.png (300 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Halloween Treats Maker 2025.png (300 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Halloween Treats Maker</div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Products</b></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\">2024</span></h4>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/teeth-treats-36170\" title=\"Teeth treats\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Teeth treats\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/worm-treats-36171\" title=\"Worm treats\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Worm treats\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/skull-treats-36172\" title=\"Skull treats\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Skull treats\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/pumpkin-treats-36174\" title=\"Pumpkin treats\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pumpkin treats\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/teeth-treats-36170\" title=\"Teeth Treats\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Teeth Treats</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/worm-treats-36171\" title=\"Worm Treats\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Worm Treats</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/skull-treats-36172\" title=\"Skull Treats\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Skull Treats</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/pumpkin-treats-36174\" title=\"Pumpkin Treats\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pumpkin Treats</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 17\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 20\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 35\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 50\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10 min\n</td>\n<td>15 min\n</td>\n<td>20 min\n</td>\n<td>20 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>★★★ 8 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 12 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 17 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 17 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>15<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>20<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>20<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>27<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>45<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>109<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>126<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Products from the Halloween Treats Maker cannot be bought or sold. They can only be loaded onto boats; each boat needing 1-3 per box. They are stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Barn</a>.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\">2025</span></h4>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/striped-candy-36441\" title=\"Striped candy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Striped candy\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\