><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>143<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>93<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Production Buildings</a></i>\n</p><p>The Halloween Treats Maker originally has two slots available. Unlocking more slots costs <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>3rd slot: 24 diamonds</li>\n<li>4th slot: 36 diamonds</li>\n<li>5th slot: 48 diamonds</li>\n<li>6th slot: 60 diamonds</li>\n<li>7th slot: 72 diamonds</li>\n<li>8th slot: 84 diamonds</li>\n<li>9th slot: 100 diamonds</li></ul>\n<p>In 2025, the Halloween Treats Maker originally has two slots available. Unlocking more slots costs <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>3rd slot: 20 diamonds</li>\n<li>4th slot: 32 diamonds</li>\n<li>5th slot: 44 diamonds</li>\n<li>6th slot: 56 diamonds</li>\n<li>7th slot: 68 diamonds</li>\n<li>8th slot: 80 diamonds</li>\n<li>9th slot: 92 diamonds</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Mastering</b></span></h3>\n<p>A total of 380 hours of production is required to <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">master</a> the Halloween Treats Maker:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><span><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AUpload\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Halloween Treats Maker Mastered.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\">Mastered Halloween Treats Maker</span></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><b>★<br>48 hrs</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>★★<br>192 hrs</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>★★★<br>140 hrs</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/aa/Halloween_Treats_Maker_Mastery_I.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021180604\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Halloween Treats Maker Mastery I\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"62\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7d/Halloween_Treats_Maker_Mastery_II.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021180613\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Halloween Treats Maker Mastery II\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/33/Halloween_Treats_Maker_Mastery_III.png/revision/latest?cb=20251027223837\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Halloween Treats Maker Mastery III\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"58\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>+10% Halloween hats from boat orders</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>+40% Halloween hats from boat orders</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>+100% Halloween hats from boat orders</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>In 2025, a total of 144 hours of production is required to <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">master</a> the Halloween Treats Maker:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/43/Halloween_Treats_Maker_2025_Mastered.png/revision/latest?cb=20251023204854\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Mastered Halloween Treats Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mastered Halloween Treats Maker\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><b>★<br>48 hrs</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>★★<br>48 hrs</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>★★★<br>48 hrs</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/33/Halloween_Treats_Maker_Mastery_III.png/revision/latest?cb=20251027223837\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Halloween Treats Maker Mastery III\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"58\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>50% faster</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>+50% Halloween hats from boat orders</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>+100% Halloween hats from boat orders</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Halloween Treats Maker is temporary production machine. Player should not spend large number of diamonds to unlock all slots, but purchase slots for sufficient production.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Rewards Catalogue</b></span></h3>\n<p>These exclusive decorations can be redeemed using <a href=\"/wiki/halloween-hat-36167\" title=\"Halloween Hat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Halloween Hats</a>.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Temporary Production Buildings</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/birthday-balloon-maker-36084\" title=\"Birthday Balloon Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Birthday Balloon Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/easter-egg-maker-35764\" title=\"Easter Egg Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Easter Egg Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/gift-wrapping-station-35675\" title=\"Gift Wrapping Station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gift Wrapping Station</a> • <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Halloween Treats Maker</strong>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/buildings-3577\" title=\"Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Buildings</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260830104357\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.116 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.161 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 685/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18194/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 454/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 6/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3607/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 968322/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   66.010      1 -total\n 56.15%   37.067      1 Template:Infobox\n 25.63%   16.919      1 Template:Infoicon\n 10.86%    7.166      2 Template:Building_Products\n 10.20%    6.731      1 Template:Navigation\n  4.94%    3.261      1 Template:New\n  3.64%    2.406      1 Templ